37084>>>>>        
37084>>>>>        If (not(CreatePasswordHash(Self, Trim(sPassword), &sPassword))) Begin
37086>>>>>            Send Clear of hoUserDD
37087>>>>>            Function_Return False
37088>>>>>        End
